    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "i.e., the mean relative fitness in a population is always equal to one, and that since $ \\mu = E(z) \\cdot E(w) = E(z) \\cdot 1 $, the directional selection differential may be rewritten as",
      "source_page": 62,
      "printed_page": 42,
